          <div>
            <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">3.5" IPS 640x480</h3>
            <p class="text-on-surface-variant font-body-md">Fully laminated display with vibrant colors and wide viewing angles.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
