    </details>
    <details class="group border-b border-outline-variant pb-md">
      <summary class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer list-none">
        <span class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface">Which payment methods are accepted?</span>
        <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-primary group-open:rotate-45 transition-transform">add</span>
      </summary>
      <p class="mt-md text-on-surface-variant font-body-md">We accept all major credit cards, PayPal, and Apple Pay through our secure, encrypted checkout process.</p>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>
